Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 22
Author: A. E. Cayo
Date: 1927-09-24
Byline: Submitted by A. E. Cayo, Beeville, Texas. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-09-24_93/page/n31/mode/1up
Number: 22
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-10-01_93/page/n31/mode/1up


#HEELS###WHEEL#
IE#LEAP#DOER#OR
N#ALONE#WORST#I
DONS#DALES#TRIP
INN###NIL###ARE
ACES#DUELS#LIEN
#EXPERT#SNAILS#
###ERA###OIL###
#CHARMS#FORAGE#
BEAK#STEEP#CAVE
ADD###OVA###MIX
BEER#CRESS#GILT
E#SABLE#TAKEN#R
